<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<odoo>
<template id="report_managerial_same_location">
     <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="o">
                <t t-call="web.external_layout">
                    <div class="page">
                        <div class="row mt32">
                            <div class="col-8">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-4" style="float:left;">
                                 <strong>Date.:</strong>
                                <span t-esc="datetime.date.today()"/>
                                <br/>
                                  <strong>Ref. No.</strong>
									<span t-field="o.app_reference"/>
                                  <br/>

                                  <br/>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                         <div class="row mt32">
                              <div class="col-12">
                                <strong><span t-field="o.partner_name"/></strong>
                                <br/>
                                <strong>Dear <span t-field="o.partner_name"/>,</strong>
                            </div>
                             </div>
                        <h6 class="text-center"><strong><u>Subject: - Promotion</u></strong></h6>
                        <br/>
                        <p>Considering your experience and remarkable contribution to the Bank, I am pleased to inform you that you are promoted to the post of <strong><span t-field="o.job_id"/></strong> (Job Grade <strong><span t-field="o.job_grade_id"/></strong> ) and assigned at <strong><span t-field="o.final_work_unit"/></strong>  effective the date you assume your new position.</p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>You will be entitled a monthly gross salary <strong>Birr <span t-field="o.job_grade_id.base_salary"/></strong>and you are entitled to other benefits attached to the position as per the benefit package.</p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>Your assignment to this post is indeed a clear indication of the Bank’s confidence in you to carry out your duties and responsibilities to its entire satisfaction with the expected standard of the Bank. The job description for the position is attached herewith for your easy reference in discharging your responsibilities.</p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>By copy of this letter,  <strong><span t-field="o.preferred_location"/></strong> is advised to release <strong><span t-field="o.partner_name"/></strong> and forward Payroll related information, Outstanding Loan Account details, Leave status, and any other necessary information to <strong><span t-field="o.final_work_unit"/> and Talent Management Directorate.</strong></p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>I hope you will capitalize on your achievement to date and look forward to enhanced performance of the  <strong><span t-field="o.final_work_unit"/></strong> in all the responsibility areas bestowed upon you.</p>
                        <br/>
                    </div>
                <div>
                               <div class="row mt32">
                                   <br/>
                             <div class="col-6">
                                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                                 <br/>
                                 <br/>


                                 <strong>CC:</strong>
								 <t t-foreach="o.cc_workunits" t-as="related_record">
                                    <li><t t-esc="related_record.name"/></li>
                                    <!-- Add more fields as needed -->
                                </t>
                                 
                                  <br/>

<!--                                <span t-field="o.resignation_type" />-->
                                  <br/>
                             </div>

                        </div>

                </div>

                </t>
            </t>
        </t>
</template>
</odoo>